 HISTORY                                                          8299 1451
 -------                                                          8299 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8299 1451
 (LEIP) group at NC State University, USA. The inelastic          8299 1451
 scattering thermal scattering law data for UO2 were developed    8299 1451
 using ab intio lattice dynamics methods [1,2]. The Full Law      8299 1451
 Analysis Scattering System Hub (FLASSH) code was used to produce 8299 1451
 File 7 MT=2 and 4 for U in UO2 and O in UO2 [3]. MAT=19 and      8299 1451
 ZA=119 were used for O (HEU - 93% U-235) in UO2 .                8299 1451
